# TURNTABLE RIM at Hyde & Beach. The squeeze re-homed the turntable to the Wharf's west end, on Jefferson St,
# with its cable car standing on it and cars parked beside it: rolling west along Jefferson just north of the
# cable car's end, an ollie across the disc's north edge, taken off and landed outside it.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport -92 922.45 -9.0 270
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x -6
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 0
hold ollie 304..334
run 500
expect event gap{id=turntable_hyde,gap=TURNTABLE RIM,points=400} within 448..452
expect no event gap{id=turntable_powell}
expect no event bail
